1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,600
You chose to call him.

2
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:03,725
He picked up on the first ring.

3
00:00:03,875 --> 00:00:04,475
Last night,

4
00:00:04,525 --> 00:00:07,480
a customer paid in coins from seventeen ninety.

5
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:08,530
By dawn,

6
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:10,427
your hand was smoking.

7
00:00:10,577 --> 00:00:11,557
He said your name.

8
00:00:11,607 --> 00:00:13,703
Your badge just says trainee.

9
00:00:13,933 --> 00:00:15,868
Sunrise is in fourteen minutes.

10
00:00:15,918 --> 00:00:17,322
He sounds bored.

11
00:00:17,472 --> 00:00:17,967
He said,

12
00:00:18,017 --> 00:00:19,822
the stockroom has no windows.

13
00:00:19,872 --> 00:00:21,565
Stay in the shadows.

14
00:00:21,635 --> 00:00:24,090
The sun is already crawling across the floor.

15
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,826
Aisle by aisle.

16
00:00:26,056 --> 00:00:26,781
Then a van pulls in.

17
00:00:26,831 --> 00:00:27,596
Dave,

18
00:00:27,646 --> 00:00:29,386
the day manager.

19
00:00:29,436 --> 00:00:30,930
Twenty minutes early.

20
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,600
He's banging on the glass.

21
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:34,039
He wants to come in.

22
00:00:34,109 --> 00:00:35,254
And from the stockroom,

23
00:00:35,304 --> 00:00:37,205
you can hear his heartbeat.

24
00:00:37,595 --> 00:00:38,740
Through the phone,

25
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:40,240
he says, I can teach you everything.

26
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:41,345
Every rule.

27
00:00:41,395 --> 00:00:42,674
For a price.

28
00:00:42,744 --> 00:00:44,948
Invite me into your home.

29
00:00:45,418 --> 00:00:47,108
Then you hear his voice twice.

30
00:00:47,158 --> 00:00:48,218
On the phone.

31
00:00:48,268 --> 00:00:49,552
And behind you.

32
00:00:49,702 --> 00:00:51,627
You invited him in last night.

33
00:00:51,677 --> 00:00:53,246
It doesn't expire.
